{"id":"msg_m_ex_bunnyx777_07","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_bunnyx777","label":"Temporary Bunny Group · Group"},"label":"6. Pit Boss.","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_bunnyx777_06","next":"msg_m_ex_bunnyx777_09","speakers":{"blanc":"Blanc","noir":"Noir","rouge":"Rouge"},"icons":{"blanc":"si_c270_00_s","noir":"si_c271_00_s","rouge":"si_c272_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"msg_m_ex_bunnyx777_07_unlock","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"text":"Unlocks: Clear event stage 101610112 · After Temporary Bunny Group chat 5. Highroller,","key":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_07_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_07_1","text":"Pit Boss.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_07_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_07_2","text":"You still remember the kiss Noir and I gave you after you won first place?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_07_3","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_07_3","text":"You bet I do.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_07_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_07_4","text":"How's your luck been holding up?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_07_5","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_07_5","text":"Not too bad.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_07_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_07_6","text":"Then can we test it?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_07_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_07_7","text":"I'm a little curious, that's all, hehe.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_07_8","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_07_8","text":"How?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_07_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_07_9","text":"Hmm...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_07_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_07_10","text":"I've got it!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_07_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_07_11","text":"I have something in my hand.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_07_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_07_12","text":"Can you guess what it is?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_07_13","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_07_13","text":"Chocolate Splendamin.","jump":"m_ex_bunnyx777_07_15"},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_07_14","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_07_14","text":"A rabbit toy that looks like Noir.","jump":"m_ex_bunnyx777_07_15"},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_07_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_07_15","text":"???!!!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_07_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_07_16","text":"Wow!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_07_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_07_17","text":"Amazing...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_07_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_07_18","text":"Are you serious?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_07_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_07_19","text":"Okay, how about this?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_07_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_07_20","text":"Do we have a show in Coin Rush today?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_07_21","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_07_21","text":"Yes.","jump":"m_ex_bunnyx777_07_23"},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_07_22","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_07_22","text":"No.","jump":"m_ex_bunnyx777_07_23"},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_07_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_07_23","text":"!!!!!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_07_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_07_24","text":"OMG!!! That's amazing, Pit Boss!!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_07_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"rouge","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_07_25","text":"You were correct both times.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_07_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"rouge","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_07_26","text":"This is beyond luck.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_07_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"rouge","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_07_27","text":"I think Highroller is clairvoyant.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_07_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_07_28","text":"I don't think so.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_07_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_07_29","text":"Because he was actually wrong both times.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_07_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"rouge","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_07_30","text":"Wait, what?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_07_31","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_07_31","text":"I was wrong?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_07_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_07_32","text":"LOLOLOL","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_07_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_07_33","text":"LOLOLOL","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_07_34","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_07_34","text":"What is this?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_07_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_07_35","text":"Don't be too mad. When you think about it, us being able","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_07_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_07_36","text":"to have such fun together is the luckiest thing of all.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_07_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"rouge","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_07_37","text":"Well well, aren't you a sweet-talker?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_07_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_07_38","text":"Hehe!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_07_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_07_39","text":"We've had so much fun hanging around with you, Pit Boss.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_07_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_07_40","text":"Yeah, tons of fun.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_07_41","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_07_41","text":"I suppose things can't be all that bad if Noir and Blanc are this gleeful.","jump":null}],"chat":true}